# Force-treat binary assets as binary so core.autocrlf=true can never apply
# CRLF/text normalisation to them. A 2-byte mangling of the MediaPipe .task
# ZIP bundles silently broke the 인스타 효과 gesture + AR-wearable models
# ("Unable to open zip archive"); marking them -text prevents a recurrence.
*.task   binary
*.tflite binary
*.wasm   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.webp   binary
*.ico    binary
*.mp4    binary
*.mov    binary
*.webm   binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.zip    binary
